      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.myswitzerland.com/en/destinations/zug/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The prehistoric settlement of Sumpf on the lake shore is part of a UNESCO World Heritage pile‑dwelling site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
